# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Expert First Aid

step Expert First Aid
  tip Expert First Aid raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, Expert First Aid - Under Wraps; the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it. The same vendor sells the Heavy Silk and Mageweave Bandage manuals: buy both now, you read them at 180 and 210.
  level 20
  train First Aid Expert "Buy and read Expert First Aid - Under Wraps (Expert First Aid)"
  buy 16112 x1 nearest
  buy 16113 x1 nearest

