# ---------------------------------------------------------------- First Aid 225-300

step Mageweave Bandage: cloth
  collect 4338 x88 nearest     -- humanoids of level 35-50 drop Mageweave Cloth (or buy it at the Auction House).

step Mageweave Bandage (225-260)
  tip Mageweave Bandage is yellow from 225 (yellow at 210, grey at 270): about 88 crafts to 260. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Mageweave Bandage stays yellow to 270; one recipe to 260 saves two trips to the doctor.
  craft 10840 until 260

step Runecloth Bandage
  tip Runecloth Bandage (skill 260) is an Artisan recipe: only the Triage doctor teaches it (Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen in Theramore, Doctor Gregory Victor in Hammerfall).
  learn 18629 npc 12939 only Alliance
  learn 18629 npc 12920 only Horde

step Runecloth Bandage: cloth
  collect 14047 x65 nearest     -- humanoids of level 45-60 drop Runecloth (or buy it at the Auction House).

step Runecloth Bandage (260-300)
  tip Runecloth Bandage is yellow from 260 (yellow at 260, grey at 320): about 65 crafts to 300. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Runecloth Bandage stays yellow to 320, so it carries you to 300 without a trip for Heavy Runecloth.
  craft 18629 until 300
